      "solution": {
        "lines": [
          "$\\sin^2 x + \\cos^2 x = 1$ ، إذن $\\sin^2 x = 1 - \\left(\\dfrac{20}{29}\\right)^2 = 1 - \\dfrac{400}{841} = \\dfrac{441}{841}$",
